    },
    "Cloned with your own git and SSH setup (keys, agent, ~/.ssh/config) into ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources. You see what it holds first: nothing in it loads or runs before you click Enable." : {
      "comment" : "用你自己的 git 和 SSH 设置（密钥、ssh-agent、~/.ssh/config）克隆到 ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources。克隆之后先给你看里面有什么，点「启用」之前什么都不会加载或运行。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/ExtensionSourcesSettings.swift",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit deinem eigenen git- und SSH-Setup (Schlüssel, Agent, ~/.ssh/config) nach ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources geklont. Zuerst siehst du, was darin enthalten ist: Nichts daraus wird geladen oder ausgeführt, bevor du auf „Aktivieren“ klickst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se clona con tu propia configuración de git y SSH (claves, agente, ~/.ssh/config) en ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources. Primero ves lo que contiene: nada se carga ni se ejecuta antes de que hagas clic en “Activar”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloné avec votre propre configuration git et SSH (clés, agent, ~/.ssh/config) dans ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources. Vous voyez d’abord ce qu’il contient : rien n’est chargé ni exécuté avant que vous cliquiez sur Activer."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自分のgitとSSHの設定（キー、エージェント、~/.ssh/config）で~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sourcesにクローンします。まず中身が表示され、「有効にする」をクリックするまで何も読み込まれず、実行もされません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "자신의 git 및 SSH 설정(키, 에이전트, ~/.ssh/config)으로 ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources에 복제합니다. 먼저 내용을 보여 주며, 활성화를 클릭하기 전에는 아무것도 불러오거나 실행하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clonado com a sua própria configuração de git e SSH (chaves, agent, ~/.ssh/config) em ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources. Primeiro você vê o que ele contém: nada nele é carregado ou executado antes de você clicar em Ativar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用你自己的 git 和 SSH 設定（金鑰、ssh-agent、~/.ssh/config）複製到 ~/Library/Application Support/AllInOneIME/Sources。你會先看到裡面有什麼：按「啟用」之前，其中的任何內容都不會載入或執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
