    "The repository's history changed (a force push), so it can't simply update: re-clone it and review it again." : {
      "comment" : "仓库的历史变了（强制推送），不能直接更新：重新克隆，并重新检查一遍。 — Sources/AllInOneIME/ExtensionSourceController.swift",
